---
export const prerender = true;

import MarketingLayout from '../layouts/MarketingLayout.astro';
---

<MarketingLayout
  title="Pricing | Insight Hunter"
  description="Compare Insight Hunter plans for operators who need AI-powered finance visibility, compliance workflows, and a modern CFO operating layer."
>
  <section class="pricing-hero">
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p>
      <h1>Clear plans for real operating teams.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Start with core finance control, then add AI advisory, deeper dashboards, and payroll-ready
        workflows as the business grows.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pricing-table-wrap">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid">
        <article class="plan featured">
          <div class="plan-badge">Most balanced</div>
          <h2>Starter</h2>
          <p class="price">Entry pricing in Stripe</p>
          <p class="summary">For founders who need one disciplined finance command layer.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>BizForma and main app access.</li>
            <li>Document vault and compliance calendar.</li>
            <li>Core operating visibility and onboarding flow.</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/auth/register?plan=starter" class="btn btn-primary">Start with Starter</a>
        </article>

        <article class="plan emphasized">
          <div class="plan-badge">Recommended</div>
          <h2>Growth</h2>
          <p class="price">Growth pricing in Stripe</p>
          <p class="summary">For small teams that want guidance, workflow leverage, and deeper visibility.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Everything in Starter.</li>
            <li>AI advisor, modular forms, advanced dashboarding.</li>
            <li>Best fit for advisory-led execution and repeatable processes.</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/auth/register?plan=growth" class="btn btn-primary">Choose Growth</a>
        </article>

        <article class="plan featured">
          <div class="plan-badge">Full operating layer</div>
          <h2>Pro</h2>
          <p class="price">Pro pricing in Stripe</p>
          <p class="summary">For businesses expanding into payroll, more complex operations, and higher control needs.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Everything in Growth.</li>
            <li>Payroll workspace and expanded finance operations coverage.</li>
            <li>Built for multi-workflow execution from one control surface.</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/auth/register?plan=pro" class="btn btn-secondary">Talk to the full stack</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pricing-context">
    <div class="container context-grid">
      <article class="context-card">
        <p class="eyebrow">What buyers need</p>
        <h3>Confidence before commitment.</h3>
        <p>
          This pricing page is meant to do more than list tiers. It should help prospects understand
          how Insight Hunter grows from core control to a broader finance operating system.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="context-card">
        <p class="eyebrow">How to package</p>
        <h3>Keep plans simple.</h3>
        <p>
          Use plan-based packaging in Stripe, then enforce capabilities through entitlements. That
          creates a cleaner buying experience and a cleaner product architecture.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pricing-faq">
    <div class="container faq-shell">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Questions</p>
        <h2>Designed to scale with the platform.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <article>
          <h3>Can plans change later?</h3>
          <p>Yes. The Stripe model supports upgrades and future add-ons without rebuilding the shell.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Is this just for bookkeeping?</h3>
          <p>No. The platform is positioned as a finance operating layer, not a single-purpose ledger tool.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Why start simple?</h3>
          <p>A cleaner pricing ladder improves conversion, operational clarity, and investor readability.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MarketingLayout>

<style>
  .container {
    width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px));
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .pricing-hero {
    padding: 84px 0 36px;
  }

  .hero-inner {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 4.2rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .lede,
  .summary,
  .context-card p,
  .faq-list p {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .pricing-table-wrap {
    padding: 18px 0 56px;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .plan,
  .context-card,
  .faq-shell {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--panel);
    border-radius: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.16);
  }

  .plan {
    padding: 24px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .emphasized {
    border-color: rgba(107, 168, 255, 0.4);
    transform: translateY(-6px);
  }

  .plan-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(65, 145, 255, 0.12);
    color: #9fc3ff;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .plan h2,
  .context-card h3,
  .faq-list h3,
  .faq-shell h2 {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .price {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .plan ul {
    margin: 18px 0 24px;
    padding-left: 18px;
    color: var(--muted);
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 46px;
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 12px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    transition: transform 0.18s ease, opacity 0.18s ease;
  }

  .btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: white;
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--text);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
  }

  .pricing-context,
  .pricing-faq {
    padding: 0 0 56px;
  }

  .context-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .context-card {
    padding: 24px;
  }

  .faq-shell {
    padding: 28px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .faq-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .grid,
    .context-grid,
    .faq-shell {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .emphasized {
      transform: none;
    }
  }
</style>
